From 2af97ce35e1f9fc349e121437b177a98bea60e7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:28:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Require the Event confirmation code to remove it

Each Event gets a random 4-digit confirmation code, generated in the
constructor when empty and stored in the record. It is shown on the show
page and must be typed in the removal form; a wrong or missing code keeps
the Event.
---
